{
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "title",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.747687074829932,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Death Takes a Service Call.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "n_title",
     "start": 1.25,
     "end": 2.747687074829932,
     "file": "audio/00_title.wav"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ticket",
   "start": 3.747687074829932,
   "end": 25.356009070294785,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Imagine Death getting a service ticket for his next pickup.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "n1",
     "start": 4.697687074829932,
     "end": 8.099410430839002,
     "file": "audio/01_ticket.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Oh, I got a service ticket for the next one. Let's see... thirty-something-year-old dude, named Jesus. Former carpenter. Should be located between two thieves. Alright, I'll go pick him up and bring him to the afterlife. Let's go.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "tk",
     "start": 8.699410430839002,
     "end": 24.756009070294784,
     "file": "audio/02_ticket.wav"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "walk",
   "start": 25.356009070294785,
   "end": 46.609818594104304,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Death walks along the path to the cross, whistling, looking side to side, bored out of his skull. He checks his watch.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "w1",
     "start": 26.206009070294783,
     "end": 33.71766439909297,
     "file": "audio/03_walk.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "silence",
     "text": "",
     "tag": "whistle",
     "start": 33.71766439909297,
     "end": 35.71766439909297,
     "file": null
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Alright. I've got time to take the skull dog for a walk after this.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "dogw",
     "start": 36.017664399092965,
     "end": 40.499115646258495,
     "file": "audio/04_walk.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "He kicks a stone along in front of him, staring at his feet.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "kick",
     "start": 41.0991156462585,
     "end": 44.7098185941043,
     "file": "audio/05_walk.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "silence",
     "text": "",
     "tag": "kicked",
     "start": 44.7098185941043,
     "end": 45.9098185941043,
     "file": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cross",
   "start": 46.609818594104304,
   "end": 90.86267573696145,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "At the foot of the cross, Death stretches nice and wide, eyes closed. A little cough. Then he looks up at Jesus.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "c1",
     "start": 47.459818594104306,
     "end": 55.08757369614512,
     "file": "audio/06_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "silence",
     "text": "",
     "tag": "beat",
     "start": 55.08757369614512,
     "end": 55.787573696145124,
     "file": null
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "And his jaw drops straight to the floor. A blinding, divine light fills his face.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "c2",
     "start": 55.98757369614513,
     "end": 60.9914739229025,
     "file": "audio/07_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "What the actual... is going on? Hey, God! What are you doing?",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "wtf",
     "start": 61.7914739229025,
     "end": 65.6575963718821,
     "file": "audio/08_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "f",
     "text": "Thank you for picking up my Son.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "thanks",
     "start": 66.3575963718821,
     "end": 67.87850340136055,
     "file": "audio/09_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "What are you talking about? This is just some guy. Anybody could say he's the Son of God. Why this man? Can you please turn down the light?",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "why",
     "start": 68.47850340136054,
     "end": 77.31369614512471,
     "file": "audio/10_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "f",
     "text": "Ha, ha. Well... you'll see when you bring him up here. We can have a conversation.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "see",
     "start": 78.01369614512471,
     "end": 81.58956916099773,
     "file": "audio/11_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "...It looks like I'm going to have to delay walking my skull dog.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "delay",
     "start": 82.48956916099773,
     "end": 86.1118820861678,
     "file": "audio/12_cross.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "f",
     "text": "Oh, don't worry. You can walk your dog with him now. Bring him up.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "bring",
     "start": 86.8118820861678,
     "end": 90.06267573696145,
     "file": "audio/13_cross.wav"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "carry",
   "start": 90.86267573696145,
   "end": 124.58931972789117,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Death takes the Son of Man down from the cross. He weighs about a hundred times more than Death is used to.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "c3",
     "start": 91.71267573696146,
     "end": 97.62215419501135,
     "file": "audio/14_carry.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "What the actual heck is going on?",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "heck",
     "start": 98.22215419501134,
     "end": 100.17263038548754,
     "file": "audio/15_carry.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Death touches the feet of the thieves, and their souls pop out. Red. With little horns.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "thieves",
     "start": 100.77263038548753,
     "end": 106.29897959183674,
     "file": "audio/16_carry.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Okay. Well, those guys went to hell, so at least they're out of the way.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "hell",
     "start": 106.99897959183674,
     "end": 112.0377097505669,
     "file": "audio/17_carry.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "f",
     "text": "No. Send them up to me. The Son of Man said they will be in Paradise as well.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "para",
     "start": 112.7377097505669,
     "end": 116.7315419501134,
     "file": "audio/18_carry.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Gosh dang it. Now I have to go talk to the devil, and tell him to send those two back up to You.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "devil",
     "start": 117.5315419501134,
     "end": 123.78931972789117,
     "file": "audio/19_carry.wav"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "whisper",
   "start": 124.58931972789117,
   "end": 151.64657596371885,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "From his perch on Death's shoulder, Jesus whispers into his ear.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "nwh",
     "start": 125.43931972789117,
     "end": 129.24739229024945,
     "file": "audio/20_whisper.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "j",
     "text": "Thy will has been done.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "will",
     "start": 129.84739229024945,
     "end": 131.0896598639456,
     "file": "audio/21_whisper.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Behind them, the two red souls begin to glow. The horns fade away. And the devil souls turn into divine light.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "change",
     "start": 131.5896598639456,
     "end": 138.84589569161,
     "file": "audio/22_whisper.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Oh, what the heck is going on now? This dude is breaking all the rules. I have no idea what's going on anymore. Alright. Here you go, Father.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "rules",
     "start": 139.74589569161,
     "end": 149.84657596371883,
     "file": "audio/23_whisper.wav"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "arrive",
   "start": 151.64657596371885,
   "end": 194.0867346938776,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Death pops into heaven in a cloud of smoke, and drops Jesus.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "pop",
     "start": 152.49657596371884,
     "end": 156.71099773242634,
     "file": "audio/24_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Jesus lands on the ground with a very loud thud.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "thud",
     "start": 157.01099773242635,
     "end": 160.02959183673474,
     "file": "audio/25_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "f",
     "text": "Arise, Son of Man! The one sent from heaven to save the world!",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "arise",
     "start": 160.92959183673474,
     "end": 164.70283446712023,
     "file": "audio/26_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "Jesus casually stands up, brushing the dust off his feet. Death stands around awkwardly, looking everywhere except at anyone, waiting for someone to tell him he can leave.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "stand",
     "start": 165.40283446712021,
     "end": 176.64129251700683,
     "file": "audio/27_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Yeah. So. I should probably... get out of here...",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "awk",
     "start": 177.24129251700683,
     "end": 180.56174603174605,
     "file": "audio/28_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "j",
     "text": "So... yeah. This is much appreciated, Father. I can now continue my work.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "thanks2",
     "start": 181.26174603174604,
     "end": 186.0798866213152,
     "file": "audio/29_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "j",
     "text": "Death, can we go for a walk? I have something important I want to tell you.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "walkask",
     "start": 186.5798866213152,
     "end": 190.53888888888892,
     "file": "audio/30_arrive.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Sure. Let me get my dog.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "getdog",
     "start": 191.1388888888889,
     "end": 193.28673469387758,
     "file": "audio/31_arrive.wav"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "dog",
   "start": 194.0867346938776,
   "end": 217.22027210884355,
   "sents": [
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "The skull dog comes rushing in from the side, tongue hanging out, barking.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "rush",
     "start": 194.93673469387758,
     "end": 199.54589569161,
     "file": "audio/32_dog.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "silence",
     "text": "",
     "tag": "bark",
     "start": 199.54589569161,
     "end": 200.54589569161,
     "file": null
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Oh, come here, you precious thing.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "precious",
     "start": 200.74589569161,
     "end": 203.05628117913835,
     "file": "audio/33_dog.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "n",
     "text": "The dog runs right past Death, without even looking at him, and jumps into the arms of Jesus.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "jump",
     "start": 203.75628117913834,
     "end": 209.81668934240363,
     "file": "audio/34_dog.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "silence",
     "text": "",
     "tag": "cuddle",
     "start": 209.81668934240363,
     "end": 211.01668934240362,
     "file": null
    },
    {
     "who": "d",
     "text": "Okay. Can we just get this walk done?",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "walkdone",
     "start": 211.31668934240363,
     "end": 214.04503401360546,
     "file": "audio/35_dog.wav"
    },
    {
     "who": "j",
     "text": "Sure, buddy.",
     "label": null,
     "tag": "sure",
     "start": 214.74503401360545,
     "end": 215.72027210884355,
     "file": "audio/36_dog.wav"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
 "total": 217.22027210884355,
 "sr": 22050
}